          <a class="row-card__heading glue-link" href=https://research.google/pubs/method-for-secure-ai-grounding-using-semantic-token-substitution-and-client-side-re-hydration/ >
            
              Method for Secure AI Grounding using Semantic Token Substitution and Client-Side Re-Hydration
            
