          <a class="row-card__heading glue-link" href=https://research.google/pubs/temper-then-tilt-principled-unlearning-for-generative-models-through-tempering-and-classifier-guidance/ >
            
              Temper-Then-Tilt: Principled Unlearning for Generative Models through Tempering and Classifier Guidance
            
          </a>
        
        <div class="row-card__subheading">
          
            
              
                
                  
                    <div class="row-card__subheading__item small-text">
                      
                        Jacob Block
                      
                    </div>
                
              
            
              
                
                  
                    <div class="row-card__subheading__spacer"></div>
